    <string name="remote_child_explain">On the device that should RECEIVE announcements, generate a pairing code and share it with the owner device (the phone that receives the payment SMS). A 6-digit code cannot carry a key, so the transferable item is this longer string — the 6 digits become the fingerprint you compare at the end.</string>
